  "thinking": "The independent measurements fit two short fine-tunes, batch inference, and ordinary baseline demand. A run above the threshold would require at least 26 full-load hours even with all 2,000 listed GPUs. The 30-day energy record and traffic and power samples across both clusters make such a run unlikely, with gaps in direct workload coverage.",
